# PI module artifacts (generated by make package)
# The tarball IS the distribution: PixInsight's updater fetches it straight
# from raw.githubusercontent, so it has to be committed, not ignored.
# repository/bin/ and repository/share/ below are only staging for it.
repository/*.xsgn
repository/bin/
repository/share/

# Test output (visual evaluation PNGs)
test/output/*.png

# ctest run artifacts
Testing/

# Claude Code agent-local state
.claude/

# Visual brainstorming companion mockups (superpowers:brainstorming skill)
.superpowers/

# Temporary
*.tmp
*.bak
